{"page":177,"verses":[{"verse_key":"8:1","surah":8,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ عَنِ ٱلْأَنفَالِ ۖ قُلِ ٱلْأَنفَالُ لِلَّهِ وَٱلرَّسُولِ ۖ فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَأَصْلِحُوا۟ ذَاتَ بَيْنِكُمْ ۖ وَأَطِيعُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥٓ إِن كُنتُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They ask you [Prophet] about [distributing] the battle gains. Say, ‘That is a matter for God and His Messenger, so be mindful of God and make things right between you. Obey God and His Messenger if you are true believers:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ","en_gloss":"They ask you","transliteration":"yasalūnaka","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"about","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْأَنفَالِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the spoils of war","transliteration":"l-anfāli","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قُلِ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"quli","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَنفَالُ","en_gloss":"The spoils of war","transliteration":"l-anfālu","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"(are) for Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلرَّسُولِ ۖ","en_gloss":"and the Messenger","transliteration":"wal-rasūli","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"So fear","transliteration":"fa-ittaqū","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَأَصْلِحُوا۟","en_gloss":"and set right","transliteration":"wa-aṣliḥū","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ذَاتَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhāta","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَيْنِكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"(which is) between you","transliteration":"baynikum","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","en_gloss":"and obey","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"8:1"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَرَسُولَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlahu"